1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
South Korea is in East Asia.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,960
It is on the southern part of the Korean Peninsula.

3
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:08,340
A peninsula is land with water on three sides.

4
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:10,060
Seoul is the capital city.

5
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,360
The Han River goes through the city area.

6
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:22,500
Gyeongbokgung Palace teaches royal history, Gwangjang Market shows market food, Myeong-dong shows visitor shopping, and the Han River gives open city space.

7
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:26,160
It was the first main palace of the Joseon dynasty in Seoul.

8
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:32,060
It teaches royal history, government history, gates, courtyards, and palace buildings.

9
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:35,660
Bukchon Hanok Village is also specific.

10
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:44,520
A hanok is a traditional Korean house, and Bukchon shows hanok roofs and narrow streets close to modern Seoul.

11
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,060
N Seoul Tower is a different kind of place.

12
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:52,880
It is on Namsan Mountain, so it teaches the idea of a city-view point.

13
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:55,240
Food in Seoul is not only one thing.

14
00:00:55,420 --> 00:00:56,880
The place changes the meal.

15
00:00:57,060 --> 00:01:07,320
A visitor can eat in Gwangjang Market, a small restaurant, a cafe, a department-store food hall, or a street-food area in Myeong-dong.

16
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,100
Gwangjang Market is the main example for market food.

17
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:13,740
It is known for a busy food street with many choices.

18
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:21,220
A visitor may see bindaetteok, a mung bean pancake, plus gimbap, handmade noodles, bibimbap, and other dishes.

19
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:25,160
Shopping in Seoul is easier when you know the job of each district.

20
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:29,500
Myeong-dong is one of Seoul's main visitor shopping areas.

21
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:35,820
Many visitors go there for clothes, cosmetics, shoes, accessories, department stores, and street food.

22
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,640
Namdaemun Market is different.

23
00:01:37,820 --> 00:01:43,740
It is near the old Namdaemun gate area and is useful for many kinds of goods, food, and small shops.

24
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:47,640
Dongdaemun is another shopping name, but its job is fashion.

25
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:54,880
Hongdae is different again: it is known for youth culture, music, cafes, fashion, and a lively street feeling.
